Z||000000||stimpy||01-29-2000||10:18 PM||||<BR>Yesterday I received the Aura Bass Shakers that I ordered off Yahoo Auctions ($170, includes 100w amp and remote volume knob and 2 Pro series Bass shakers) Holy shismet!!!Installed them today and believe me, they are better than sliced bread.  Just incase you are unfamiliar, these things look like large woofer magnets and bolt directly to the floor under seats to generate the feel of huge subwoofers without chopping up your car, or pissing off your neighbors with a thumping bass. Your cannot hear ay difference from outside the car, but in the seats you feel like you have big beat behind you.  Get yourself a pair today!!!||||reg||1
